<![CDATA[<div><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><b>Congratulations! We have received all required documentation. The funds are being transferred to the client and should be deposited to their account within the next business day. &nbsp;Please note that availability of funds may vary based on the bank at which the client's operating account resides.</b></font></div><div><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><b><br></b></font></div><div><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Business Name: {!Opportunity.Legal_Name__c}</font></div><div><font face="Arial, sans-serif">FWC Number: {!Opportunity.Merchant_Number__c}</font></div><div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial" style="font-size: 12pt;">Funded Amount:&nbsp;</font><font face="arial">{!Opportunity.Funded_Amount__c}</font></div><div><font face="arial" style="font-size: 12pt;">Term:&nbsp;</font><font face="arial" style="font-size: 12pt;">{!Opportunity.ACTUAL_MCA_TERM__c}&nbsp;</font><font face="arial">{!Opportunity.Actual_Payment_Frequency__c} P</font><span style="font-size: 12pt;">ayments</span></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial" style="font-size: 12pt;">Repayment Amount:&nbsp;</font><font face="arial">{!Opportunity.ACTUAL_AMT_COLLECTED__c}</font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">{!Opportunity.Actual_Payment_Frequency__c}&nbsp;<font face="arial" style="font-size: 12pt;">Payment:&nbsp;</font><font face="arial">{!Opportunity.Actual_Daily_Payment__c}</font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">Commission:&nbsp;{!Opportunity.Broker_Commission__c}</div></div>]]></td>
